    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><strong>Tzeentch Exalted Champion.</strong> This commander of Warriors of Chaos — Tzeentch enters the field with a complete D&D 5e profile: armor, hit points, weapons, racial traits, and tactical maneuvers are all resolved directly from the embedded items on this actor. Its battlefield presence is practical rather than ornamental: auras name their radius, diseases name their saving throws, and maneuvers state their action economy.</p><p>Use the inventory as the creature’s tactical menu. Weapons list finished attack or saving throw text; features describe the exact condition, movement, advantage, damage, recharge, or aura they create.</p><blockquote><p>“Change is not a lie; it is the shape truth takes when fools look away.”<br><em>— Kairos Fateweaver</em></p></blockquote><p><strong>Wargear and battlefield powers.</strong> This creature enters battle with Battlefield Doctrine, Ensorcelled Blade, Warpfire Bolt, Mutating Staff, Fated Mutation, Barbed Spear, Sorcerous Staff, Warpfire Blade, Leadership, Dark Favor, Whirlwind Sweep. Its drilled responses, charms, blades, and battlefield rites shape the rhythm of its turns.</p>",
